{"unit_id":"Alexander390370__dsh-laya-mcp#feature-1","repo":"Alexander390370/dsh-laya-mcp","commit":"bfb68c2853cab9ec1588eb5d2bc2ad420d27d9d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-laya 的功能「按给定类别选择」：将文本和 JSON 格式的问题定义传给模型，返回各问题的结构化答案及路由信息。通过 laya_decide 工具调用，适合选项固定的分类任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:263-304"]}
{"unit_id":"Alexander390370__dsh-laya-mcp#feature-2","repo":"Alexander390370/dsh-laya-mcp","commit":"bfb68c2853cab9ec1588eb5d2bc2ad420d27d9d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-laya 的功能「量表评分与二值判断」：按问题定义返回分数或是非概率，也可选择对二值概率进行校准。通过 laya_decide 提交问题和文本，结果以 JSON 返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:263-304"]}
{"unit_id":"Alexander390370__dsh-laya-mcp#feature-3","repo":"Alexander390370/dsh-laya-mcp","commit":"bfb68c2853cab9ec1588eb5d2bc2ad420d27d9d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-laya 的功能「服务状态查询」：查询本地模型是否已加载、设备设置和服务记录的参数，通过 laya_status 工具获取 JSON 结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:321-351"]}
{"unit_id":"Alexander390370__dsh-laya-mcp#feature-4","repo":"Alexander390370/dsh-laya-mcp","commit":"bfb68c2853cab9ec1588eb5d2bc2ad420d27d9d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-laya 的功能「按消息触发工具可见性」：可选 laya-gate 默认隐藏指定工具，用户消息包含配置触发词时临时开放，并可设置 sticky 行为。工具名和触发词在 bundle 中配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["laya-gate/index.js:100-156","laya-gate/cordis.patch.yml:1-9"]}
